ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO_PIP^실명확인번호PIP^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="310" _ulen="224" >

CUST_CLS_CODE^고객구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO_20_FGRS^실명확인번호20자리^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO_TYPE_CODE^실명확인번호유형코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
NTFR_CLS_CODE^내외국인구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
RSDT_CLS_CODE^거주자구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
	</DATAIO_INFO>
</ROOT>